# Memory storage folder for OpenClaw-style auto-memory
# This folder is mounted as /data/memory in both gateway and memory-service containers
#
# Contents:
#   daily/          - Daily conversation logs (sessional memory)
#   MEMORY.md       - Durable facts (always loaded in system prompt)
#   milvus.db       - Vector index (auto-rebuilt by memsearch.watch())
#
# Note: This folder is shared between containers via Docker volume mount
